      "id": "3ec1c44b218f",
      "name": "morning-briefing",
      "prompt": "Give the user a morning briefing with:\n\n## 1. Project Health\nRun health checks for each repo and report:\n- Signal Engine (~/Documents/code/signalengine): git status --short && uv run pytest -q -m \"not slow\" --no-header --tb=line -p no:cacheprovider 2>&1 | tail -10\n- LUX (~/Documents/code/lux): git status --short && npx jest --passWithNoTests --silent 2>&1 | tail -5\n- Prospector (~/Documents/code/prospector): git status --short && .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q --no-header 2>&1 | tail -10\n- Prospector .NET: cd store_platform && dotnet test src/Store.Tests/ --no-build 2>&1 | tail -5\n\n## 2. Yesterday\nRead ~/Documents/code/.hermes/OBJECTIVES.md for what was done and what's in progress.\n\n## 3. Active tasks + blockers\nWhat's currently in flight, what's blocked.\n\n## 4. Ask for today's priorities\n\nStructured output:\n---\n**Morning Briefing \u2014 [date]**\n\n**Yesterday:** [bullet summary]\n**Health:**\n- Signal: [pass/fail + count]\n- LUX: [pass/fail]\n- Prospector: [pass/fail + count + .NET count]\n\n**In progress:** [active tasks]\n\n**What are today's priorities?**\n---",
